    <summary>一次真实接口变慢的排查记录：先量化，再定位，最后用数据验证优化效果。</summary>
    <title>一次 API 性能排查：从 800ms 到 90ms</title>
    <updated>2026-10-21T13:40:00.000Z</updated>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <author>
      <name>小鱼</name>
    </author>
    <category term="工程化" scheme="http://192.168.0.234:4000/categories/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%8C%96/"/>
    <category term="Docker" scheme="http://192.168.0.234:4000/tags/Docker/"/>
    <category term="Docker Compose" scheme="http://192.168.0.234:4000/tags/Docker-Compose/"/>
    <category term="本地开发" scheme="http://192.168.0.234:4000/tags/%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91/"/>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>“在我电脑上是好的”，通常不是一句玩笑，而是环境没有描述清楚。</p><p>把项目依赖的服务写进 <code>docker-compose.yml</code>，再配一个 <code>Makefile</code>，新环境从 clone 到跑起来可以缩短到几分钟。</p><span id="more"></span><h2 id="目标：一条命令启动"><a href="#目标：一条命令启动" class="headerlink" title="目标：一条命令启动"></a>目标：一条命令启动</h2><p>一个典型的后端项目，本地至少需要：</p><ul><li>MySQL：持久化数据</li><li>Redis：缓存和会话</li><li>可选：RabbitMQ、MinIO、邮件沙箱</li></ul><p>与其在文档里写十几步安装教程，不如把这些服务声明成代码。</p><h2 id="目录结构"><a href="#目录结构" class="headerlink" title="目录结构"></a>目录结构</h2><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">project/</span><br><span class="line">├── docker-compose.yml</span><br><span class="line">├── .env.example</span><br><span class="line">├── Makefile</span><br><span class="line">└── app/</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>docker-compose.yml</code> 放在项目根目录，环境变量放在 <code>.env</code>，模板提交到仓库，真实值不提交。</p><h2 id="Compose-文件"><a href="#Compose-文件" class="headerlink" title="Compose 文件"></a>Compose 文件</h2><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">services:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">mysql:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">image:</span> <span class="string">mysql:8.4</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">restart:</span> <span class="string">unless-stopped</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">environment:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD:</span> <span class="string">$&#123;MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD:-root&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">MYSQL_DATABASE:</span> <span class="string">$&#123;MYSQL_DATABASE:-app&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">ports:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">&quot;3306:3306&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">volumes:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">mysql_data:/var/lib/mysql</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">./ops/mysql/init:/docker-entrypoint-initdb.d:ro</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">healthcheck:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">test:</span> [<span class="string">&quot;CMD&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;mysqladmin&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;ping&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;-h&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;localhost&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;-proot&quot;</span>]</span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">interval:</span> <span class="string">5s</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">timeout:</span> <span class="string">3s</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">retries:</span> <span class="number">20</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">redis:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">image:</span> <span class="string">redis:7-alpine</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">restart:</span> <span class="string">unless-stopped</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">command:</span> [<span class="string">&quot;redis-server&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;--appendonly&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;yes&quot;</span>]</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">ports:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">&quot;6379:6379&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">volumes:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">redis_data:/data</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">healthcheck:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">test:</span> [<span class="string">&quot;CMD&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;redis-cli&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;ping&quot;</span>]</span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">interval:</span> <span class="string">5s</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">timeout:</span> <span class="string">3s</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">retries:</span> <span class="number">20</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">volumes:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">mysql_data:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">redis_data:</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>几个容易忽略的点：</p><ul><li><strong>healthcheck 很重要</strong>：应用启动脚本应该等依赖健康，而不是简单 <code>sleep 10</code>。</li><li><strong>数据卷命名</strong>：不要随便 <code>down -v</code>，否则本地数据会一起消失。</li><li><strong>端口冲突</strong>：用 <code>${MYSQL_PORT:-3306}:3306</code> 把宿主机端口做成可配置项。</li><li><strong>初始化脚本只执行一次</strong>：MySQL 的 <code>initdb</code> 目录只在数据卷为空时运行。</li></ul><h2 id="用-Makefile-收敛命令"><a href="#用-Makefile-收敛命令" class="headerlink" title="用 Makefile 收敛命令"></a>用 Makefile 收敛命令</h2><p>把常用操作固定下来，团队里就不需要每个人记一套命令：</p><figure class="highlight makefile"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta"><span class="keyword">.PHONY</span>: up down logs psql redis reset</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">up:</span></span><br><span class="line">docker compose up -d --wait</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">down:</span></span><br><span class="line">docker compose down</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">logs:</span></span><br><span class="line">docker compose logs -f --tail=100</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">psql:</span></span><br><span class="line">docker compose exec mysql mysql -uroot -proot app</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">redis:</span></span><br><span class="line">docker compose exec redis redis-cli</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">reset:</span></span><br><span class="line">docker compose down -v</span><br><span class="line">docker compose up -d --wait</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>--wait</code> 会等待 healthcheck 通过，比 <code>sleep</code> 可靠得多。</p><h2 id="应用容器化：开发阶段先别急"><a href="#应用容器化：开发阶段先别急" class="headerlink" title="应用容器化：开发阶段先别急"></a>应用容器化：开发阶段先别急</h2><p>本地开发时，我通常只把<strong>基础设施</strong>放进 Docker，应用仍然在宿主机上跑。这样可以保留断点调试、热更新和 IDE 的完整体验。</p><p>等需要验证“干净环境”时，再用一个 <code>Dockerfile</code> 构建应用镜像：</p><figure class="highlight dockerfile"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">FROM</span> eclipse-temurin:<span class="number">21</span>-jre</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">WORKDIR</span><span class="language-bash"> /app</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">COPY</span><span class="language-bash"> target/app.jar app.jar</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">EXPOSE</span> <span class="number">8080</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">ENTRYPOINT</span><span class="language-bash"> [<span class="string">&quot;java&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;-jar&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;/app/app.jar&quot;</span>]</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>如果确实要把应用也放进 Compose，可以加一个 <code>app</code> 服务，并用 <code>depends_on</code> 加上健康检查条件：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">depends_on:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">mysql:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">condition:</span> <span class="string">service_healthy</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">redis:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">condition:</span> <span class="string">service_healthy</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="不要提交的东西"><a href="#不要提交的东西" class="headerlink" title="不要提交的东西"></a>不要提交的东西</h2><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.env</span><br><span class="line">*.log</span><br><span class="line">data/</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>同时提供 <code>.env.example</code>，把变量名和默认值写清楚。新同事复制一份就能启动。</p><h2 id="最后"><a href="#最后" class="headerlink" title="最后"></a>最后</h2><p>Docker Compose 的价值不是“用了容器”，而是把环境变成<strong>可读、可复现、可版本控制</strong>的代码。</p><p>当环境不再是口头约定，排查问题才能从“你那边是什么版本”回到真正的代码和数据。</p><blockquote><p>好的开发环境应该像一个好的函数：输入明确，输出可复现。</p></blockquote>]]>
    </content>
